  <model metaid="meta_omeprazole_kidney" id="omeprazole_kidney" name="Model for the renal excretion of the omeprazole metabolites" substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <h1>Model for the renal excretion of the omeprazole metabolites</h1>
        <ul>
          <li>no omeprazole and no omeprazole sulfone are excreted in the urine</li>
          <li>5-hydroxyomeprazole and the other metabolites are excreted from the
plasma into the urine, with clearances relative to the glomerular
filtration rate (GFR)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
